Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Description: Delta web browser
 A native GTK and WebKitGTK browser with tabs, bookmarks, history,
 downloads, persistent website login sessions, and offline game.
